-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.154</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">δύω νύκτας, τρεῖς ν.,</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">388</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17.515</span> </span>: in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ὅλην τὴν ν.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pherecr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">177</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Amphis</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.4</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὴν νύχθ' ὅλην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eub.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰς νύκτας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Diph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">32.14</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὅλας γε καὶ πάσας τὰς ν.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.54</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">νύκτας τε καὶ ἦμαρ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.490</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">νύκτας τε καὶ ἡμέρας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">151a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὔτε νύκτ' οὔθ' ἡμέραν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ba.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">187</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὴν νύχθ' ὅλην τήν θ' ἡμέραν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eub.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">53.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">